# Cloudflare Pages redirect map for the apex.
#
# The apex used to be the whole site. When it split into three, its solar,
# electrical and blog pages moved to the division subdomains and the copies
# left here were byte-identical duplicates of pages live on two other hosts.
# They have been deleted; these send anything Google already indexed — or any
# bookmark, or any link on someone else's site — to where the page now lives,
# rather than to a 404.
#
# 301, not 302: the move is permanent, and only a 301 passes ranking on.
#
# Paths are extensionless because scripts/build-site.js rewrites every link
# and canonical to the extensionless form and Cloudflare Pages 308s
# /solar.html to /solar. Both spellings are listed so a link written the old
# way still lands somewhere useful in one hop rather than two.
#
# This file is NOT processed by the build's link rewrite (that walks .html and
# the sitemap only), so what is written here is what ships.

# --- Energy: solar, batteries, backup, energy management -------------------
/solar                      https://energy.sunlogic.co.za/solar                 301
/solar.html                 https://energy.sunlogic.co.za/solar                 301
/energy-management          https://energy.sunlogic.co.za/energy-management     301
/energy-management.html     https://energy.sunlogic.co.za/energy-management     301

# --- Electrical: contracting, compliance, EV charging ----------------------
/electrical                 https://electrical.sunlogic.co.za/electrical        301
/electrical.html            https://electrical.sunlogic.co.za/electrical        301

